text:
Meet our opener! - MAW: Y2K FURRY RAVE 
7PM-8PM

@revelionart.bsky.social  returns to MAW as Furtual Self, an alternative genre alias playing old school trance, techno, breakcore and hardcore from Japanese rhythm game music of the 90s-2000s mixed alongside their modern counterparts.

"There are only three S.T.A.R.S. members left now: Captain Wesker, Jill, and myself. We don't know where Barry is."

@Laceyjames007 as Wesker
@Valtiel.spencer as Jill Valentine
